<title>UK: One Brent cargo kept before deadline - traders.</title>
<headline>One Brent cargo kept before deadline - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single set of Brent dates from Wednesday's paper chains was kept before the five o'clock deadline by Norwegian state oil company Statoil, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the July 24-26 window. - London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
